---
import CatalogLayout from "~/layouts/CatalogLayout.astro";

const title = "Slides | Colors";
const description = "Presentations about Colors workflows, Package Skills, and Context Skills. Read online or download a PDF.";
---

<CatalogLayout {title} {description} path="/slides" active="slides">
  <section class="wrap slides-page">
    <header class="slides-header">
      <p class="section-label">Presentations</p>
      <h1>Slides</h1>
      <p class="lede">An introduction to Colors and the workflows you can build with it, and a deck on the Kubernetes controller and the operators built on it. Present in your browser or download the PDF.</p>
    </header>
    <article class="deck-card">
      <a class="deck-image" href="/slides/green-kubernetes/" aria-label="View Kubernetes in three colors slides">
        <img src="/og-slides-green-kubernetes-v2.png" alt="Register the workflow. Let a controller keep it converged." width="1200" height="630" />
      </a>
      <div class="deck-body">
        <p class="deck-meta">14 slides · 20–25 minutes</p>
        <h2><a href="/slides/green-kubernetes/">Kubernetes in three colors</a></h2>
        <p>How Green, Red and Blue Kubernetes controllers keep registered workflows converged. Covers all three versions of Redis Operator and DOKS, runtime selection, and the live deployment and recovery checks from 16 September 2026.</p>
        <p class="event-note">Closes with the same invitation to the <a href="/blog/community-town-hall">Community Town Hall on 18 September 2026</a>.</p>
        <div class="deck-actions">
          <a class="view-deck" href="/slides/green-kubernetes/">View slides</a>
          <a href="/slides/green-kubernetes/green-kubernetes.pdf" download>Download PDF</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="deck-card">
      <a class="deck-image" href="/slides/introduction/" aria-label="View Introduction to Colors slides">
        <img src="/og-colors-v4.png" alt="Describe the infrastructure. Get the complete workflow." width="1200" height="630" />
      </a>
      <div class="deck-body">
        <p class="deck-meta">10 slides · 10–15 minutes</p>
        <h2><a href="/slides/introduction/">Introduction to Colors</a></h2>
        <p>How an agent turns infrastructure requirements into colors.yml and executable workflow code. Covers Package Skills, Context Skills, and running a deployment without an agent.</p>
        <p class="event-note">Includes an invitation to the <a href="/blog/community-town-hall">Community Town Hall on 18 September 2026</a>.</p>
        <div class="deck-actions">
          <a class="view-deck" href="/slides/introduction/">View slides</a>
          <a href="/slides/introduction/introduction.pdf" download>Download PDF</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</CatalogLayout>

<style>
  .slides-page { padding-block: 62px 80px; }
  .slides-header { max-width: 800px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .deck-card + .deck-card { margin-top: 28px; }
  .deck-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: 32px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; }
  .deck-image { display: block; align-self: start; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 9px; }
  .deck-image img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .deck-meta { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--soft); font: 12px var(--mono); }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 30px; }
  h2 a { color: var(--ink); }
  .deck-body > p:not(.deck-meta) { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
  .event-note { font-size: 14px; }
  .deck-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; align-items: center; margin-top: 24px; font: 13px var(--mono); }
  .view-deck { display: inline-block; padding: 13px 18px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--on-dark); }
  .view-deck:hover { background: oklch(30% 0.01 260); color: var(--on-dark); }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--blue); outline-offset: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .deck-card { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); padding: 20px; gap: 24px; } .slides-page { padding-block: 36px 60px; } }
</style>
